cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ImagePro Classifier Teaching Tool"
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit teaching app for training a two-class image classifier.
  Users upload two labeled image sets, train a ResNet-18 model either
  from a pretrained checkpoint or from scratch, and classify a test image.
authors:
  - family-names: Amodeo
    given-names: John
repository-code: "https://github.com/jmamodeo/classifier-teaching-tool"
keywords:
  - image classification
  - transfer learning
  - resnet
  - streamlit
  - teaching
